8,"text":"One of those encampments is guarded by the \"Top\"...","nextNodeIds":[400330104]},{"nodeId":400330104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2743767018,"text":"Ahem. I mean, by \"Black Shadow.\" If you've got no other questions...","nextNodeIds":[400330105]},{"nodeId":400330105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":122887082,"text":"As for yesterday's investigations...","nextNodeIds":[400330106]},{"nodeId":400330106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2004332970,"text":"As for that, I don't know anything at the moment.","nextNodeIds":[400330107]},{"nodeId":400330107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1361729714,"text":"Eh!? Didn't Sango get you to go investigate?","nextNodeIds":[400330108]},{"nodeId":400330108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":3455150042,"text":"She did, yes, but... How should I put it?","nextNodeIds":[400330109]},{"nodeId":400330109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":1651866874,"text":"For example, \"some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\" don't connect meaningfully in my mind.","nextNodeIds":[400330110]},{"nodeId":400330110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2531363042,"text":"But for Sango, these are the materials she needs to unlock mysteries as complex as \"yosegizaiku.\"","nextNodeIds":[400330111]},{"nodeId":400330111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1822958794,"text":"\"Some overripe Lavender Melons\" and \"muddy hand-prints on a door\"... How are these related, actually?","nextNodeIds":[400330112]},{"nodeId":400330112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":831674466,"text":"I'm just using an analogy. At her direction, I investigated some locations in Yashiori Island and Chinju Forest before reporting what I had seen back to her.","nextNodeIds":[400330113]},{"nodeId":400330113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":423988170,"text":"As for any conclusions she might have drawn from my reports, only she knows what they are.","nextNodeIds":[400330114]},{"nodeId":400330114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":932461786,"text":"To be honest, only Shikanoin is able to keep up with her train of thought...","nextNodeIds":[400330115]},{"nodeId":400330115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":657886562,"text":"Shikanoin?","nextNodeIds":[400330116]},{"nodeId":400330116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":330677602,"text":"Someone from the Tenryou Commission. We had the privilege of making his acquaintance on a previous case.","nextNodeIds":[400330117]},{"nodeId":400330117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":2674108090,"text":"He's a rather... unique character. You'll know what I mean should you ever meet him.","nextNodeIds":[400330118]},{"nodeId":400330118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3042,"speakerName":"Ryuuji","textMapHash":314996538,"text":"Well then. The animals are in your hands.","nextNodeIds":[400330119]},{"nodeId":400330119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1686016874,"text":"Paimon's still thinking about those \"overripe Lavender Melons\"...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4003301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_G